# Copy this file to .env, fill in real values, and set the same
# variables in the Vercel project's Environment Variables settings.
# Nothing here works without real credentials — the /api/contact
# function silently skips email / sheets writing when a var is missing.

# --- Resend (email notifications) ---------------------------------
#   1. https://resend.com -> API Keys -> create one (or reuse the
#      existing MenuFrame Studio key)
#   2. RESEND_API_KEY = that key
#   3. INQUIRY_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL = the address that should receive them
#   The sender address (onboarding@resend.dev) works out of the box for
#   testing but lands in spam; a verified custom domain fixes that.
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# INQUIRY_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL=

# --- Google Sheets (inquiry log) -----------------------------------
# This writes into the SAME spreadsheet + main tab used by the
# MenuFrame Studio product (columns: Дата | Заведение | Контакт | Email
# | Текущо меню/сайт | Предпочитан стил | Съобщение | Статус | id) —
# use the exact same values as that project's .env, no separate sheet
# or tab needed.
#   1. Reuse the existing Google service account JSON from the
#      MenuFrame Studio project (Google Cloud Console -> IAM -> Service
#      Accounts).
#   2. GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_EMAIL = the "client_email" field from that JSON
#   3. GOOGLE_PRIVATE_KEY = the "private_key" field from that JSON, exactly
#      as-is (it contains literal \n sequences — keep them, the code
#      converts them to real newlines).
#   4. GOOGLE_SHEETS_SPREADSHEET_ID = the same spreadsheet ID as in the
#      MenuFrame Studio project's .env
# GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_EMAIL=
# GOOGLE_PRIVATE_KEY=
# GOOGLE_SHEETS_SPREADSHEET_ID=
